---
import { Box } from "@lucide/astro";
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
---

<>
<section class="w-full flex-center mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="w-full col-center gap-14 max-w-6xl my-14 md:my-16 lg:my-20">
        <div class="col-center gap-2">
            <span class="flex-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 bg-white border border-[#e4e4e4] rounded-full">
                <Box size={18} stroke-width={2} class="text-gray-800" />
                <h4 class="text-[13px] md:text-[15px] font-medium  text-gray-800">
                    Importance
                </h4>
            </span>
            <h2 class="h2-bold text-center">
                Why Compliance Matters for Your Business
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-500 max-w-3xl text-justify md:text-center px-auto">
                Choosing Warehouster means partnering with an industrial park developer who prioritizes legal security, regulatory adherence, and ethical practices. Here’s why our compliance-first approach benefits your business:
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full col-center gap-4 md:gap-5">
            <div class="w-full flex-stretch gap-4 md:gap-5">
                <div class="w-full md:w-[30%] py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl">
                    <div class="w-full flex justify-end pb-7">
                        <div class="w-14 md:w-20 lg:w-24 p-2 aspect-square rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-[#ffb485]">
                            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-[#F6670B] flex-center">
                                <Image src="/icons/approv-icon-1.webp" alt="approv-icon-1" width={60} height={60} class="w-[55%]" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">Assured Legal Integrity</h3>
                        <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            Fully statutory-approved and legally verified parks reduce the risk of disputes or operational delays.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full md:w-[35%] py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl">
                    <div class="w-full flex justify-end pb-7">
                        <div class="w-14 md:w-20 lg:w-24 p-2 aspect-square rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-[#ffb485]">
                            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-[#F6670B] flex-center">
                                <Image src="/icons/approv-icon-2.webp" alt="approv-icon-2" width={60} height={60} class="w-[55%]" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">Peace of Mind</h3>
                        <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            With Warehouster handling all regulatory, legal, and compliance requirements, you can focus on business growth without worrying about statutory issues.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full md:w-[35%] py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl">
                    <div class="w-full flex justify-end pb-7">
                        <div class="w-14 md:w-20 lg:w-24 p-2 aspect-square rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-[#ffb485]">
                            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-[#F6670B] flex-center">
                                <Image src="/icons/approv-icon-3.webp" alt="approv-icon-3" width={60} height={60} class="w-[55%]" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">Minimized Operational Risks</h3>
                        <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            Thorough land title verification, environmental clearances, and safety compliance protect your investment and ensure smooth operations.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex-stretch gap-4 md:gap-5">
                <div class="w-full md:w-[40%] py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl">
                    <div class="w-full flex justify-end pb-7">
                        <div class="w-14 md:w-20 lg:w-24 p-2 aspect-square rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-[#ffb485]">
                            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-[#F6670B] flex-center">
                                <Image src="/icons/approv-icon-4.webp" alt="approv-icon-4" width={60} height={60} class="w-[55%]" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">Sustainable Business Practices</h3>
                        <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            Adhering to ethical, environmental, and corporate governance standards helps maintain a positive reputation and long-term growth.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full md:w-[60%] py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl">
                    <div class="w-full flex justify-end pb-7">
                        <div class="w-14 md:w-20 lg:w-24 p-2 aspect-square rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-[#ffb485]">
                            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-[#F6670B] flex-center">
                                <Image src="/icons/approv-icon-5.webp" alt="approv-icon-5" width={60} height={60} class="w-[55%]" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">Investor and Stakeholder Confidence</h3>
                        <p class="text-base lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            Transparent approvals and proper documentation enhance trust among investors, banks, and regulatory authorities.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
</>
